        "action": "Reintroduce dog licences for dog owners",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "Reintroduce mandatory dog licences for all owners. Licence conditions should include mandatory behaviour training. The licence fee could cover the administration costs of the scheme and fund additional resources for dog wardens and dog fouling clean-up.",
